# renders and intermediates
out/
**/out/
*.mp4
!examples/*.mp4
!examples/**/demo.mp4

# generated soundtrack (`om sound` writes it from the page's OM.music/OM.sfx declarations;
# a 8 s film is ~1.5 MB, a 31 s film ~5.7 MB — never commit it)
assets/sound.wav
**/assets/sound.wav

# vendored deps (fetch with scripts/vendor-three.mjs instead)
vendor/
**/vendor/

# generated self-checks and review frames (regenerate with `om still` / `qa-sheet.mjs`)
**/_selfcheck/
**/review/

# local scratch
_verify/
**/_verify/

# scratch stills (a leading underscore marks "not part of the repo")
**/_*.png
**/_*.jpg

# agent/tool noise
.om/
node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
